{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1473393","title":"Aerobic granular sludge macrotranscriptome","description":"Aerobic granular sludge samples were collected on day 280 from laboratory-scale sequential batch reactors (SBRs) treating synthetic wastewater (low C/N ratio). The inoculated sludge was originally obtained from a municipal wastewater treatment plant in Beijing, China. Reactors were operated under different long-term exposure conditions: control (R0, no micro/nanoplastics), microplastics (R2, polystyrene, 10 mg/L), and nanoplastics (R4, polystyrene, 5 mg/L). These metatranscriptomic samples were used to investigate the active microbial community, functional gene expression levels (e.g., c-di-GMP metabolic pathway genes), and key species involved in extracellular polymeric substance regulation under micro/nanoplastic stress. Sampling location: Beijing University of Technology, Beijing, China.","center":"Beijing University of Technology","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/06/01 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN60560011","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2024-02-04",2024,"CN","Beijing",1816670,"Beijing","probable",39.8754,116.4806,"China: The laboratory in Beijing","Sludge in R0",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN60560012","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2024-02-04",2024,"CN","Beijing",1816670,"Beijing","probable",39.8754,116.4806,"China: The laboratory in Beijing","Sludge in R0",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN60560013","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge metagen